 "url": "https://forum.netmarble.com/futurefight_en/view/2213/1642115",
 "html": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1598840270464\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/a98b7f98aa75420c8bbfb821fa0e0d01_1598840270464_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Greetings, Agent!</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">This is CM Fragment of MARVEL Future Fight.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">As one of the greatest Mutant leaders and master of the weather,<br>\nStorm will take charge in the battle of Inhumans vs. X-Men!</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Let’s look to how much of an impact she will create in battle<br>\nwith her new uniform and her blasting Tier-3 Mutant power!</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Meet the new Storm after downloading 9/1 Patch data!</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">[9/1 3:16&nbsp;a.m. (UTC+0) / 8/31 8:16&nbsp;p.m. (PDT) Added]</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">The patch has been completed. Please reconnect to the game and download the patch file.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\"><strong>■ 9/1 Patch</strong></span><br>\n<strong>&nbsp;Patch Schedule:</strong> 9/1 2:00 a.m. (UTC+0) / 8/31 7:00 p.m. (PDT)<br>\n<span style=\"color:#c0392b;\">* The patch will be applied in waves, so the patch application time may vary.<br>\n* The game can be played during the patch,&nbsp;<br>\nbut we recommend our Agents reconnect to the game to apply the patch once it is available.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<strong><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▣ 1 New Uniform</span></span></span></strong><br>\n&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#c0392b;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">[9/1 4:26 a.m. (UTC+0) / 8:31 9:26 p.m. (PDT) Added]<br>\nWe have fixed an error from the new unifrom details.<br>\nWe apologize to our Agents for creating confusion.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#c0392b;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Active 1 Skill &lt;Lightning Dash&gt; Paralysis (Ignores Immunity)(3 Sec.) → (2 Sec.)</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1598934361404\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/b90748d3f36548718bd49040424fa9e0_1598934361404_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"color:#3498db;\">- Character Skills are based on Level 6 stats.</span></strong><br>\n<span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">* The new uniform will be available for purchase after the 9/1 Patch at the standard price<br>\n&nbsp; &nbsp;and will be discounted during the event.<br>\n* The new uniform will be on sale during the upcoming event and will be available for purchase in the Marvel Universe and Uniform Room after the event.&nbsp;</span><br>\n&nbsp;<br>\n&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▣ Tier-3 Storm</span></span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1598840453978\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/a9655b80b87249a383b3e74747562de0_1598840453978_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"222\" id=\"1598840470798\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/9aa9b357a8b345a59cbafcd96adf655d_1598840470798.gif\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"398\"></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Make sure to check various growth Events that have been prepared along with the Patch!</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Thank you.&nbsp;</span></span><br>\n&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"170\" id=\"1598840514620\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/357db9a294a9469bb20d7e748f63f6a9_1598840514620_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"735\"></p>\n"
